OL,3,GNEWSAZack Polanski says he'll run for
OL,4,Aformer PM Starmer's seat in by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Keir announced on Tuesday that he
OL,7,Fwas quitting as MP for the London
OL,8,Fconstituency, two months after he stood
OL,9,Fdown as prime minister, setting up a
OL,10,Fchallenging by-election for his
OL,11,Fsuccessor Andy Burnham.
